WEBVTT

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:30.042
and could stop the cycle
of exploitation and extraction.

00:10:31.502 --> 00:10:32.711
Every community,

00:10:32.753 --> 00:10:35.798
every community has the right
to a clean environment.

00:10:35.839 --> 00:10:40.219
And you do not need to be
an environmental champion

00:10:40.219 --> 00:10:44.390
or a climate justice leader
to embrace that value.

00:10:45.099 --> 00:10:47.601
So I call on your humanity

00:10:47.643 --> 00:10:51.355
to center the voices
and perspectives in all policies

00:10:51.397 --> 00:10:54.650
of those most affected
by environmental hazards

00:10:54.692 --> 00:10:56.402
and climate change.

00:10:56.443 --> 00:11:00.364
We can create a legacy
of environmental quality